      of day event in day cycle manager) that way after that order is served it can
      do to the day score and upgrade scene","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"9f9d3135-ca84-43c9-a2f7-2ea46488e968","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-63.0,"yMin":833.0,"xMax":304.0,"yMax":897.0},"title":"Order
      number","body":"Order number will determine which order in the day it is","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ece03158-715b-466b-9f05-00accfd118fa","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1751.0,"yMin":2198.0,"xMax":2041.0,"yMax":2310.0},"title":"Logic
      for this","body":"If you don''t have this then do you at least have something
      like it? (We dont remove it from the possible list because what if the next
      thing in the skewer is a perfect match)","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"93962281-bc8a-474a-a0d1-5f6e845fe860","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1897.0,"yMin":1644.0,"xMax":2128.0,"yMax":1744.0},"title":"Hairball?","body":"This
